WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.300
1.26M Government Contracts Scanned — 70,270 Anomalies Found.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:15.937
Algorithmic analysis of every proactive disclosure contract published by the Government of Canada on open.canada.ca.

00:00:15.937 --> 00:00:21.650
Two anomaly types detected at scale: vendor concentration and amendment chains.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:25.350
Every number is computed from the government's own data.
